[4.17, "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mWrite a ray tracer in Rust.\u001b[39m                                                                                           \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mFollow the algorithm in the attached \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mspec.md\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m (based on \"Ray Tracing in One Weekend\"): spheres with diffuse, metal\u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mand glass materials, a fixed camera, the scene described in \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mscene.md\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m, and the random number generator described in\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mrng.md\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m with seed 42.\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mRequirements:\u001b[39m                                   "]
[4.173, "                                                                      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m- Image size 400 x 225, 200 samples per pixel, max bounce depth\u00a010.\u001b[39m                                                   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m- Write the image to \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mout.ppm\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m in the PPM (P3) format described in \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mspec.md\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m.\u001b[39m                                             \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m- Single file, standard library only, no third-party packages.\u001b[39m                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m- It must build and run with: rustc -O main.rs -o main && ./main\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mWhen it runs and writes \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mout.ppm\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m, stop and tell me.\u001b[39m                                                                    \r\u001b[16B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;21"]
